            "title": "True",
            "id": 62115,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [
              {
                "id": "41d560a0-322c-4422-b428-caf11623cc72"
              }
            ],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><img src=\"41d560a0-322c-4422-b428-caf11623cc72\" visible-if=\"always\" /><p>C'è un valore speciale che non è <em>né</em> una stringa <em>né</em> un numero: <code>true</code>.</p><p>Non ci sono virgolette intorno e non è un valore numerico.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Displaying true",
            "id": 62052,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>true</code> è utile in situazioni come verificare se un interruttore è attivo o se una funzionalità è abilitata.</p><p>Visualizza <code>true</code> nella console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Allow updates&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"46\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Allow updates\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Saving true ",
            "id": 62050,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo memorizzare <code>true</code> in una variabile proprio come una stringa o un numero.</p><p>Memorizza <code>true</code> in una variabile e visualizzalo nella console.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" correct = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(correct);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"41\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>true</code>, seguito da <code>correct</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo memorizzare <code>true</code> in una variabile proprio come una stringa o un numero.</p><p>Crea una variabile chiamata <code>enabled</code> per un'impostazione attiva, poi visualizza il suo valore speciale nella console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"enabled\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"log\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"enabled\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;true&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"disabled\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>enabled</code>, seguito da <code>true</code> e infine <code>enabled</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "False",
            "id": 62049,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [
              {
                "id": "581c9bf2-4254-41a8-babe-529b2f7e4feb"
              }
            ],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><img src=\"581c9bf2-4254-41a8-babe-529b2f7e4feb\" visible-if=\"always\" /><p><code>false</code> è un altro valore speciale ed è l'opposto di <code>true</code>. Puoi usarlo come <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Displaying false",
            "id": 62048,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Salva il valore <code>false</code> nella variabile <code>status</code> e visualizza <code>status</code> nella console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Device charged&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" status = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(status);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Device charged\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>false</code>, seguito da <code>status</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mantieni il primo messaggio, poi usa <code>charged</code> per memorizzare il valore speciale di un dispositivo non carico e visualizzalo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"log\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Device charged&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"charged\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"log\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"charged\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;false&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"status\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Device charged\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>charged</code>, seguito da <code>false</code> e infine <code>charged</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 62132,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è un buon utilizzo per i valori <code>true</code> e <code>false</code>?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">Mostrare se una funzionalità è attivata o disattivata</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Memorizzazione di valori da uno a cinque</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Mostrare se una funzionalità è attivata o disattivata.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Devi registrare se la riproduzione automatica è attiva o disattiva. Quale opzione rappresenta direttamente questi due stati?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">I valori speciali <code>true</code> e <code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Un numero da uno a cinque</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Una stringa contenente il nome della funzionalità</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">I valori speciali <code>true</code> e <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 62134,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché <code>false</code> non è una stringa?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" autoPlay = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Non ci sono virgolette intorno</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">È memorizzato all'interno di una variabile</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Non ci sono virgolette intorno.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi le virgolette attorno a <code>false</code> nel codice mostrato. Cosa cambia?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" autoPlay = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>autoPlay</code> memorizza una stringa anziché il valore speciale <code>false</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Il valore memorizzato resta uguale perché le lettere non sono cambiate.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Visualizza <code>false</code> nella console anziché memorizzare un valore.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>autoPlay</code> memorizza una stringa anziché il valore speciale <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 62133,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scegli quella più adatta per mostrare che un utente ha annullato l'iscrizione a un servizio.</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>const subscribed = false;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>const subscribed = true;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>const subscribed = false;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un utente ha annullato un abbonamento. Quale dichiarazione registra correttamente questo stato?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>const subscribed = false;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>const subscribed = true;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>const subscribed = \"false\";</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const subscribed = false;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 62135,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché <code>\"false\"</code> non è uguale a <code>false</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ci sono virgolette attorno, quindi <code>\"false\"</code> è una stringa</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"false\"</code> e <code>false</code> sono la stessa cosa</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ci sono virgolette attorno, quindi <code>\"false\"</code> è una stringa.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hai i valori <code>true</code> e <code>\"false\"</code>. Quale modifica rende entrambi i valori stringhe?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Aggiungi le virgolette attorno a <code>true</code> e lascia invariato <code>\"false\"</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Rimuovi le virgolette da <code>\"false\"</code> e lascia invariato <code>true</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Aggiungi le virgolette attorno a <code>true</code> e rimuovile da <code>\"false\"</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Aggiungi le virgolette attorno a <code>true</code> e lascia invariato <code>\"false\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 62203,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mostra lo stato dell'impostazione di aggiornamento automatico visualizzando <code>false</code> nella console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Auto update&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Auto update\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>console</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e poi <code>log</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>false</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mantieni il primo messaggio. Visualizza il valore speciale <code>true</code> o <code>false</code> che indica che l'aggiornamento automatico è disattivato.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"log\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Auto update&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"log\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"alert\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;false&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Auto update\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>console</code>, seguito da <code>.</code>, <code>log</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>false</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 2",
            "id": 62204,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea la variabile <code>autoSaveImage</code> e memorizza al suo interno <code>true</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" autoSaveImage = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const</code>, seguito da <code>autoSaveImage</code> e infine <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dichiara un'impostazione attivata chiamata <code>autoSaveImage</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" autoSaveImage = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;true&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const</code>, seguito da <code>autoSaveImage</code> e infine <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 3",
            "id": 62205,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Impedisci i cookie creando la variabile e memorizzandoci <code>false</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" allowCookies = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;false&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>allowCookies</code>, seguito da <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dichiara <code>allowCookies</code> in modo che i cookie non siano consentiti.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"allowCookies\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;false&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const</code>, seguito da <code>allowCookies</code> e infine <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 4",
            "id": 62206,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Modifica le impostazioni della riproduzione automatica codificando <code>true</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" autoPlay = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"21\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 7162,
        "title": "Negazione dei valori",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "True to false",
            "id": 62046,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [
              {
                "id": "c36a47d0-0c24-47c9-ad61-1010d797bdce"
              }
            ],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><img src=\"c36a47d0-0c24-47c9-ad61-1010d797bdce\" visible-if=\"always\" /><p>Un segno <code>!</code> davanti a <code>true</code> fa sì che il risultato dell'espressione sia <code>false</code>. Se qualcosa non è true, deve essere false.</p><p>Il segno <code>!</code> è l'<strong>operatore di negazione</strong>. Trasforma i valori nel loro <strong>opposto</strong>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Change true to false",
            "id": 62047,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando cambiamo un valore nel suo opposto con <code>!</code>, lo neghiamo.</p><p>Metti un segno <code>!</code> prima di <code>true</code> per cambiarne il valore.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(!\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"17\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>!</code>, seguito da <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando cambiamo un valore nel suo opposto con <code>!</code>, lo neghiamo.</p><p>Nega una volta il valore speciale <code>true</code> o <code>false</code> affinché la console visualizzi <code>false</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(!\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;true&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>!</code>, seguito da <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Change false to true",
            "id": 62044,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Anche l'operatore <code>!</code> prima di <code>false</code> ne cambia il valore. Se un valore non è <code>false</code>, deve essere <code>true</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(!\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"18\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>!</code>, seguito da <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Anche l'operatore <code>!</code> prima di <code>false</code> ne cambia il valore. Se un valore non è <code>false</code>, deve essere <code>true</code>.</p><p>Usa la negazione per far visualizzare alla console <code>true</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(!\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!!\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;false&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>!</code>, seguito da <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Negate variables",
            "id": 62040,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare l'operatore <code>!</code> con le variabili per negare i valori che memorizzano.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isMorning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(!isMorning);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"46\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>!</code>, seguito da <code>isMorning</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare l'operatore <code>!</code> con le variabili per negare i valori che memorizzano.</p><p>Memorizza che è mattina, poi fai mostrare alla console che la mattina è finita.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isMorning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(!isMorning);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"isEvening\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!!\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>true</code>, seguito da <code>!</code> e infine <code>isMorning</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
