            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa l'operatore di negazione e memorizza un valore nella variabile.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" allowPopups = !\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>!</code>, seguito da <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa l'operatore di negazione e memorizza un valore nella variabile.</p><p>Imposta <code>allowPopups</code> in modo che i pop-up non siano consentiti.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"allowPopups\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"!\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!false\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;true&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>!</code>, seguito da <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
